config.gamedropsbackport.sulfurCube.tooltip=The sulfur cube.
config.gamedropsbackport.sulfurCube.enabled.tooltip=Off, nothing is registered, and a world that has them loses them.
config.gamedropsbackport.sulfurCube.extraBlocks.tooltip=More blocks a sulfur cube swallows, one per line: modid:block=kind or modid:block@meta=kind. The kinds are bouncy, explosive, fast_flat, fast_sliding, high_resistance, hot, light, regular, slow_bouncy, slow_flat, slow_sliding and sticky. Blocks another mod lists in the ore dictionary as stone, cobblestone, logs, planks, wool, ores or metal blocks are swallowed already.
config.gamedropsbackport.sulfurCaves.tooltip=The sulfur caves and sulfur springs.
config.gamedropsbackport.sulfurCaves.enabled.tooltip=Sulfur caves and sulfur springs generate in newly generated chunks.
config.gamedropsbackport.poplar.tooltip=Poplar wood, the red shrub, shelf mushrooms and the dappled forest.
config.gamedropsbackport.poplar.enabled.tooltip=Off, nothing is registered, and a world that has them loses them.
config.gamedropsbackport.poplar.generateBiome.tooltip=Dappled forests generate in newly generated chunks. Off, the biome is not registered.
config.gamedropsbackport.softBlocks.tooltip=Wool and concrete stairs and slabs, cushions and straw beds.
config.gamedropsbackport.softBlocks.enabled.tooltip=Off, nothing is registered, and a world that has them loses them.
config.gamedropsbackport.camps.tooltip=Abandoned camps and explorer maps.
config.gamedropsbackport.camps.enabled.tooltip=Abandoned camps generate in newly generated chunks.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.tooltip=26.x's menus and screens. Backport Core's Look & Feel page has the same switches.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.enabled.tooltip=Off, this mod adds none of 26.x's menus and screens, and an older backport's stay.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.panorama.tooltip=26.3's title screen panorama: the dappled forest with an abandoned camp.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.splashes.tooltip=26.1 to 26.3's splash text changes.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.menuMusic.tooltip=26.2's menu music: fingerspit's Ebb, Home, Memories, Nightly and Shores in place of 1.21.6's five.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.gameMusic.tooltip=26.2's game music: fingerspit's Ebb, Home, Memories, Nightly and Shores play among the other tracks in survival and creative.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.pauseMenu.tooltip=26.2's pause menu: Report Bugs, Give Feedback, Friends and Player Reporting as one row of icon buttons.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.titleScreen.tooltip=26.2's title screen: Friends, Language and Accessibility as one row of icon buttons under Realms.
config.gamedropsbackport.lookAndFeel.worldOptions.tooltip=26.3's World Options screen on the pause menu, in place of Open to LAN; Difficulty leaves the Options screen.
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.tooltip=26.x's changes to commands, mobs, blocks and items 1.12.2 already has.
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.enabled.tooltip=Off, every change below is off and 1.12.2's behavior is back.
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.timeCommand.tooltip=/time runs on world clocks: set day, noon, night and midnight go forward to the next one; pause, resume and rate; of <clock>; query time and timelines; 26.1's messages (26.1).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.gameRuleMessages.tooltip=/gamerule answers with 26.x's messages, and setting a rule to its current value is an error (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.teamColorNames.tooltip=Team colors take only their lowercase names with underscores, such as dark_purple (26.2).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.bedBounce.tooltip=Beds send what falls on them back up at 75%% of its speed instead of 66%% (26.2).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.mushroomStew.tooltip=Mushroom stew is made from a bowl and any two mushrooms (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.shieldBeforeTools.tooltip=With a shield in the off hand, using a hoe or shovel raises the shield; sneak to till or make paths (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.endermenRiding.tooltip=Endermen riding something take damage from projectiles and never teleport (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.teleportTargets.tooltip=Endermen never teleport onto bedrock or into fire, cactus, magma and the like; shulkers never onto bedrock (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.persistentMobsIdle.tooltip=Persistent mobs (named ones, for example) stop wandering when no player is within 32 blocks (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.leaderZombieHealth.tooltip=Leader zombies spawn with their raised maximum health filled (26.1).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.witchCloseThrows.tooltip=Witches throw their potions more slowly within 2 blocks, so they no longer miss up close (26.1).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.peacefulSpawnEggs.tooltip=On Peaceful, dispensers keep the spawn eggs of monsters instead of using them up (26.2).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.sunDamageEnchantments.tooltip=Unbreaking works on the helmet a zombie or skeleton wears against the sun (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.spectatorPortals.tooltip=Spectators go through nether portals, end portals and end gateways (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.ocelotsPeaceful.tooltip=Ocelots spawn in jungles on Peaceful too: the monster spawn pass runs, its monsters refused (26.2).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.spamThresholds.tooltip=Chat and commands have their own spam counters, set by chat-spam-threshold-seconds and command-spam-threshold-seconds in server.properties (10 each; 0 never kicks). Open to LAN never kicks (26.2).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.hostGameModeDefault.tooltip=The host changing their own game mode with /gamemode (or F3 + N) also changes the world's default game mode (26.2; 26.3 took this back out, so it is off by default).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.advancementCounts.tooltip=/advancement grant and revoke take several players and answer as 26.3 does: how many players and advancements, and an error only when nothing changed (26.2, 26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.teamJoinCounts.tooltip=/scoreboard teams join and leave answer as 26.3's /team does: the members that joined or left, and no error for those already out of a team (26.3).
config.gamedropsbackport.changes.unpublish.tooltip=/unpublish closes a world opened to LAN: other players leave and it stops being listed (26.2).
